                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The 2nd is the Ensuring Access to Abortion Act, which bars any person or state gov from punishing women traveling over state lines for reproductive health care. GOP state legislators & their allies are already threatening to prosecute women who do: we can't let that happen. 3/3",
