                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "No person should have to travel across state lines to access basic health care--and they should never be intimidated or threatened with legal or criminal actions for doing so. I proudly voted to pass the Ensuring Access to an Abortion Act on Friday. 1/2",
