                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Heart disease is the #1 cause of death for Americans, and South Asian populations living in the U.S. have 4x the risk of heart disease, compared to the general population, which is why I voted this week to pass the South Asian Heart Health Awareness & Research Act. 1/2",
